tpm-pin (1.0.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Flatpak packaging manifest with GNOME 50 runtime support.
  * Add standalone Flatpak build helper script with bundle export and install options.
  * Support host delegation via flatpak-spawn in GTK4/Libadwaita settings app.
  * Integrate Flatpak package generation into build script and CI/CD workflow.
  * Add AppStream metainfo XML metadata for desktop software centers.
  * Add comprehensive contribution guidelines and GitHub issue template.

